            "text": "\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ \u003cstrong\u003eWatch the course video carefully\u003c/strong\u003e — I'll be walking you through the concepts with real-life examples.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ \u003cstrong\u003eRead the course material\u003c/strong\u003e — it goes deeper into the 'why' and gives you extra insight you might not catch in the video.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ \u003cstrong\u003eDon't skip the quiz\u003c/strong\u003e — it's not just a test; it's a learning tool. The questions are designed to help you reflect and remember.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
